  "capability_profile": {
    "summary": "GLFW 是窗口系统与图形上下文管理库，深度涉及桌面 GUI（窗口创建/事件循环/输入处理）和 3D 渲染（OpenGL/Vulkan 上下文创建）两大鸿蒙适配重点场景。不涉及媒体编解码和特定硬件设备。",
    "scenarios": [
      {
        "key": "gui",
        "present": true,
        "kind": [
          "win32",
          "cocoa",
          "x11",
          "wayland"
        ],
        "specific_hardware": false,
        "via": [
          "native_api.groups[type=win32]",
          "native_api.groups[type=cocoa]",
          "native_api.groups[type=x11]",
          "native_api.groups[type=wayland]"
        ],
        "harmony_status": "unknown",
        "adaptation": "GLFW 核心功能就是窗口系统抽象层。鸿蒙 PC 的窗口/显示服务形态未知，需为新平台编写完整后端（类似现有 Win32/Cocoa/X11/Wayland 后端），或寻找等价的鸿蒙窗口 API（如 ArkUI 原生窗口）。工作量巨大——几乎等于重写一个新平台后端。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/win32_window.c",
          "src/cocoa_window.m",
          "src/x11_window.c",
          "src/wl_window.c"
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "rendering_3d",
        "present": true,
        "kind": [
          "opengl",
          "vulkan",
          "opengl_es",
          "egl"
        ],
        "specific_hardware": false,
        "via": [
          "native_api.groups[type=vulkan]",
          "native_api.dynamic_libraries[name=libGL.so]",
          "native_api.dynamic_libraries[name=libEGL.so]",
          "native_api.dynamic_libraries[name=libvulkan.so]"
        ],
        "harmony_status": "partial",
        "adaptation": "鸿蒙提供 OpenGL ES/EGL（partial）和 Vulkan（unknown）。GLFW 的 OpenGL/Vulkan 上下文创建需要对应平台的原生渲染表面（VkSurfaceKHR/EGLSurface），鸿蒙需提供等价的窗口-渲染表面绑定 API。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/context.c",
          "src/vulkan.c",
          "src/egl_context.c",
          "src/glx_context.c"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
